        br
        | • Disease names in MGeND were mapped to MedGen using a proprietary method, so they may not match the disease names listed in MGeND.
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Tools for data processing
      table.table
        thead
          tr
            th Name
            th Ver.
            th Description
            th Author
        tbody
          tr
            td
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://samtools.github.io/bcftools/') bcftools
            td 1.20
            td Split multiallelic sites into biallelic variants, exclude reference mismatches, and normalize them
            td Genome Research Ltd.
          tr
            td
              a(href="/doc/datasets/analysis") BioReT
            td ‐
            td Identify germline short variants (SNPs and Indels) in WES from JGA to produce a joint callset in VCF format
            td
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://amelieff.jp/') Amelieff
          tr
            td
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://gatk.broadinstitute.org/hc/en-us/articles/360035535932-Germline-short-variant-discovery-SNPs-Indels') GATK Best Practice - Germline short variant discovery (SNPs and Indels)
            td 4
            td Identify germline short variants (SNPs and Indels) in WGS from JGA to produce a joint callset in VCF format.
            td Broad Institute
          tr
            td
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://github.com/informationsea/transanno') transanno
            td 0.45
            td Accurate VCF LiftOver tool for converting genome assemblies from GRCh37 to GRCh38
            td OKAMURA, Yasunobu
          tr
            td
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://www.ensembl.org/info/docs/tools/vep/index.html')
                | Variant Effect Predictor (VEP)
            td Ensembl release 116
            td
              | Add
              |
              a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://www.ensembl.org/info/docs/tools/vep/script/vep_cache.html#cache_content')
